::L3 AI Decision Tree Depth 1::
In a paper-based decision tree with a depth of \(1\), what is the maximum number of yes/no decision paths available to classify an animal?
[difficulty:hard]
[chapter:Introduction to AI]
[tags:ai,decision_tree,math]
{
    =\(2^{1}\)
    ~\(1\)
    ~\(2\)
    ~\(2\)
}

::L3 AI Decision Tree Depth 2::
In a paper-based decision tree with a depth of \(2\), what is the maximum number of yes/no decision paths available to classify an animal?
[difficulty:hard]
[chapter:Introduction to AI]
[tags:ai,decision_tree,math]
{
    =\(2^{2}\)
    ~\(2\)
    ~\(4\)
